{"availability":"available","full":"Azelliott/GreenSeed","name":"GreenSeed","description":"GreenSeed is a full-featured e-commerce platform for buying and selling all kinds of plants and accessories. Built with Django and Bootstrap, it offers a sleek and intuitive interface for browsing and purchasing products.","category":"Design","language":"Python","stars":4,"forks":2,"created":"2022-11-19T20:11:05Z","updated":"2023-02-14T11:46:10Z","branch":"main","homepage":"","topics":["bootstrap5","cloud","css","django4-1","e-commerce","full-stack-web-development","html","javascript","postgresql","stripe-payments","unit-testing"],"demo":"https://greenseed-azelliott.herokuapp.com/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T00:29:41.881Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T00:29:41.881Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T00:29:41.881Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T00:29:41.881Z","stars":4,"forks":2}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Welcome to GreenSeed, the premier online destination for all of your plant-related needs. At GreenSeed, we are passionate about bringing nature into people's lives and helping them create their own little corner of the world.","Founded over a decade ago, GreenSeed has grown from a small brick and mortar shop into a major player in the world of e-commerce. As a B2C company, our focus is on providing an exceptional shopping experience for our customers.","At GreenSeed, we offer a wide range of products, including everything from seeds to fully grown plants, as well as a variety of plant accessories. With hundreds of plants from around the globe, we have something for everyone, no matter what your style or space."],"features":["Home page is has clean design with a button that leads to the web shop.","At the bottom there is an option to subscribe to newsletter","Our plants page contains several pictures and descriptions of how the company sustainably grows and sources their plants.","It also conta